  "prefLabel": "Fis 403.12 Lake Trout (Salvelinus namaycush) The daily limit for lake trout taken in freshwaters of the state shall not exceed 2 fish whether taken from a single waterbody",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 403.12 Lake Trout (Salvelinus namaycush) The daily limit for lake trout taken in freshwaters of the state shall not exceed 2 fish whether taken from a single waterbody or several waterbodies. More restrictive limits specified in Parts Fis 406 and Fis 407 shall apply to specific waterbodies.\n\nSource. #5280, eff 1-1-92; ss by #6629, eff 1-1-98; ss by #8442, eff 1-1-06; ss by #10425, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13698, eff 7-26-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 400); ss by #14418, eff 10-22-25, EXPIRES: 10-22-35",
